claim.claim-text:
a control body;
a cartridge, comprising:
a reservoir tank configured to contain an aerosol precursor composition;
an opening configured to the permit aerosol precursor composition to pass therethrough; and
two or more separate sections, wherein at least two of the sections are configured to permit the aerosol precursor composition to pass therethrough, and at least one of the sections comprises a flavor section that contains a flavorant; and
